@startuml data-flow
!theme plain
title Data Flow - Review Processing Pipeline

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

actor "User" as User
participant "Play Store" as PlayStore
participant "Collector" as Collector
participant "Cleanser" as Cleanser
database "MySQL" as MySQL
participant "Analyzer" as Analyzer
participant "Gemini API" as Gemini
database "OpenSearch" as OpenSearch
database "Redis" as Redis
participant "Web App" as WebApp

== Data Collection (Batch) ==

Collector -> PlayStore: Fetch reviews
PlayStore --> Collector: Raw reviews
Collector -> Cleanser: Raw reviews
Cleanser -> Cleanser: Remove profanity
Cleanser -> Cleanser: Fix typos
Cleanser -> Cleanser: Remove emojis
Cleanser -> MySQL: Store raw + cleansed

== Analysis Pipeline ==

MySQL -> Analyzer: Get unprocessed reviews
loop For each review
    Analyzer -> Gemini: Sentiment analysis
    Gemini --> Analyzer: Sentiment + Reasoning

    Analyzer -> Gemini: Category classification
    Gemini --> Analyzer: Categories + Metrics

    alt Negative sentiment
        Analyzer -> Gemini: Complaint classification
        Gemini --> Analyzer: Complaint + Department
    end

    Analyzer -> Gemini: Generate embedding
    Gemini --> Analyzer: Vector (768 dims)

    Analyzer -> OpenSearch: Index document
end

== User Query ==

User -> WebApp: Search similar reviews
WebApp -> OpenSearch: KNN search
OpenSearch --> WebApp: Similar reviews
WebApp -> Redis: Cache result
WebApp --> User: Display results

User -> WebApp: View dashboard
WebApp -> Redis: Check cache
alt Cache hit
    Redis --> WebApp: Cached data
else Cache miss
    WebApp -> OpenSearch: Aggregation query
    OpenSearch --> WebApp: Statistics
    WebApp -> Redis: Store cache
end
WebApp --> User: Display dashboard

@enduml
